          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP503 - Smith-Dorrien Trail

Posted: N50 41.506 W115 09.142

MyGPSr: N50 41.505 W115 09.144&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A fairly easy find, even as it was sprinkling a bit. Climbed a short ways and spotted the cap in a rock outcropping on the &quot;ridgeline.&quot; It was about 8 inches from a small rock pile. Flush with the ground. Clean cap. Thanks for another one.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
