&lt;p&gt;I'm surprised that I'm the first find of 2012 for this easily achieved brass cap along the Smith-Dorrien Trail.  This was my last of 3 Brass Caps today, a record for Caps for us for sure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap!!  BigR&lt;/p&gt;

